## 4. Network Architecture

```text
                    Internet
                       |
                Internet Gateway
                       |
              Public Route Table
                       |
                Public Subnet
                 10.1.2.0/24
                       |
                  NAT Gateway
                  Elastic IP
                       |
              Private Route Table
              0.0.0.0/0 -> NAT
                       |
                Private Subnet
                 10.1.1.0/24
                       |
              Private EC2 Instance
                xfusion-priv-ec2
                       |
             Outbound internet access
                       |
